{
  "id": "25353_houkisuru",
  "headword": "{放棄|ほうき}する",
  "reading": "ほうきする",
  "romaji": "houkisuru",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "to abandon; to renounce; to give up",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to abandon; to give up; to relinquish",
      "explanation": "To voluntarily cease holding onto or pursuing something, such as a right, plan, or possession."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "25353_houkisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{権利|けんり}を{放棄|ほうき}する。",
      "english": "To relinquish a right.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25353_houkisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}は{試合|しあい}を{途中|とちゅう}で{放棄|ほうき}した。",
      "english": "He abandoned the match midway through.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25353_houkisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{責任|せきにん}を{放棄|ほうき}するわけにはいかない。",
      "english": "I can't just abandon my responsibilities.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25353_houkisuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{相続|そうぞく}{放棄|ほうき}の{手続|てつづ}きは{家庭|かてい}{裁判所|さいばんしょ}で{行|おこな}う。",
      "english": "The procedure for renouncing an inheritance is done at family court.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A formal word for giving up or relinquishing something deliberately. Often used in legal and official contexts. The noun {放棄|ほうき} is frequently used in compound forms.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {権利|けんり}を{放棄|ほうき}する: to waive a right\n- {責任|せきにん}{放棄|ほうき}: abandonment of responsibility\n- {相続|そうぞく}{放棄|ほうき}: renunciation of inheritance\n- {試合|しあい}{放棄|ほうき}: forfeiting a match\n- {核|かく}{放棄|ほうき}: nuclear disarmament\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {諦|あきら}める: to give up — more emotional and personal; implies accepting defeat\n- {捨|す}てる: to throw away — more concrete; implies discarding something\n- {断念|だんねん}する: to abandon (a plan) — focuses on reluctantly giving up an ambition or plan",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
